<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.6">
<l>taṇṇaṉa villai namaṉta markaḷ</l>
<l rend="indent">cālakko ṭumaikaḷ ceyyā niṟpar</l>
<l>maṇṇoṭu nīru meriyuṅ kālum</l>
<l rend="indent">maṟṟumā kācamu māki niṉṟāy.</l>
<l>eṇṇalām pōtēyuṉ nāma mellām</l>
<l rend="indent">eṇṇiṉē ṉeṉṉaikku ṟikkoṇ ṭeṉṟum</l>
<l>aṇṇalē nīyeṉṉaik kākka vēṇṭum</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The attendants of Yama, who is without compassion,</l>
<l rend="indent">will continue doing numerous cruelties.</l>
<l>You stood, on the other hand, having become earth,</l>
<l rend="indent">water, fire, wind, and ether.</l>
<l>Whenever I could think, I thought of all your names,</l>
<l rend="indent">take [that as] an indication of my [devotion],</l>
<l>O Lord! You must protect me,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
